Can be used via RichTextEditor and RichTextEditorReadonly as well, like:

```tsx
<RichTextEditor
  ref={rteRef}
  extensions={extensions}
  RichTextFieldProps={{
    RichTextContentProps: { disableDefaultStyles: true },
  }}
/>
```

```tsx
<RichTextReadOnly
  content={content}
  extensions={extensions}
  RichTextContentProps={{ disableDefaultStyles: true }}
/>
```

