- ✅ Server starts successfully on default port 8080
- ✅ Server starts successfully with custom PORT environment variable
- ✅ GET "/" returns correct message "Arcanos backend running"
- ✅ Console shows proper format "✅ Server running on port ${port}"
- ✅ All existing endpoints (/health, POST /) remain functional
- ✅ OpenAI integration and error handling preserved

## Notes

These changes are minimal and surgical, maintaining all existing functionality including:
- OpenAI service integration
- Health check endpoint
- POST endpoint for natural language processing
- Error handling and graceful shutdown
- Environment configuration

The server now follows the standard Express.js backend template format while retaining its advanced features.

